    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84560" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοστ-ημόριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόριον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a number of times smaller,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαπλάσιος,</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				147a26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1020b28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαπλάσιον ἢ π. τοῦ πρότερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1308b2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π.</span>”
				<i>fraction,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Top.</u>
					125a9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ π. ὧν σε δεῖ παθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DDeor.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.110
			</span></i> K.</div>
